title: Renaissance — review polish batch 2 + a latent blocked_on crash fix
summary: 'Executed 4 more team-review UI refinements: collapsed calibration strip shows a glanceable summary + force-expands cold-start (moat never hidden); CellGrid prior cells ramp by n/8 progress-to-graduation (cold grid becomes a live map); proposedClaimant surfaced as a distinct ''→ owner'' hint on unclaimed cards + empty unclaimed lane hidden; cross-run dependsOn ids resolve via /:id (deduped/cached) so deps stop rendering ''unknown''. Caught + fixed a latent runtime crash the builder introduced: blocked_on (a backend reason STRING) was mistyped as string[] and .join()-ed, which throws whenever a blocked task renders. Build green, CLI 441. Board loose-tasks verified working (a stale leftover serve briefly returned loose:0 — lesson: kill all serves before smoke-testing).'
